      "content": "thanks this is a good start. it's solid and professional.\n\nbut i feel like it's a little bit generic for this one. since they were so close and we really liked them personally, i want it to feel less like a form letter. can u make it feel a bit more warmer and \"human\"? i don't want to be unprofessional, but i want them to feel like we actually bonded with them during the interviews. maybe something that acknowledges the connection we felt without being weird?",
